'''Beron''' or '''Beronese Baliscans''' ({{Langx|oc|Baliscans Beronés}}; {{Lang-bl|Baliscanos Beroneses}}) refers to [[Baliscans]] citizens of full or partial [[Beron people|Beron]] ancestry or persons born in the [[Kingdom of Berona]] who now reside in [[Balisca]]. Beron Baliscans form the one of the largest [[Illypnian Baliscans|Illypnian ethnic]] groups in the confederation. The earliest Berons to settle in Balisca were [[Catharism|Cathars]] arriving under charter from the Volisan Crown, the 16th century who settled in the [[Estuaria|Estuarian wetlands]].

Baliscans of Beron descent make up a substantial proportion of the Baliscan population, and have historically played an integral role in the socioeconomic development of the Baliscan archipelago (i.e. [[Volisan aristocracy]]).

